1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,110
Every morning, my grandmother's house
woke up to the smell of coffee.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:14,490
First, Emama spreads the fresh grass and
lines up the cups on the little table.

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:20,450
As the green beans roast in the pan, the
smoke calls the whole neighbourhood.

4
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:26,370
Fanning the smoke toward us, she says:
"Come, drink coffee."

5
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:32,070
The incense smoulders, and the house
fills with peace.

6
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:39,010
The first round is abol, the second
tona, the third bereka.

7
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:44,330
With every round, the stories grow
longer and the laughter louder.

8
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,550
Emama always said: "Coffee is only an
excuse. What matters is being together."

9
00:00:55,240 --> 00:01:00,330
Today, far from home, every time I make
coffee, I remember that smoke.

10
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:09,830
That is tizita. Don't leave before the
third round. Call them today.
